name minimalist
category Package
revision 64280
shortdesc Write your articles or books in a simple and clear way
longdesc This package offers you a LaTeX style file and two classes to
longdesc typeset articles or books in a simple and clear way. These
longdesc classes currently have native support for English, French,
longdesc German, Italian, Portuguese (European and Brazilian), and
longdesc Spanish typesetting. They compile with any major TeX engine.
longdesc You may also wish to consider the packages einfart and
longdesc simplivre, which are enhanced versions of the classes provided
longdesc here. They have unicode support, thus can only be used with
longdesc either XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX. Currently they have native support
longdesc for Chinese (both simplified and traditional), English, French,
longdesc German, Italian, Japanese, Portuguese (European and Brazilian),
longdesc Russian and Spanish typesetting, and also use more beautiful
longdesc fonts.
